{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93f47189-121e-87a0-9ab7-d17926d390da",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T11:20:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water and Sewer billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Carmela Conti. I'm at 111 Bacheller Street. I got a water bill and it's, ugh, it's wrong address on the mail. It goes to my old place and I get it late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you want the mailing address changed. Where should it go now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "To the house, 111 Bacheller. And I want to go paperless. No more paper, mi sono stancata, I'm tired of the mail. Sorry. I'm tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I can update the mailing address on the account right now. For paperless, we'd set that up with an email address. Do you have one you want to use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but I'll do it on the website. I don't want to say it on the phone. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that works. I'll fix the address on my end and you can finish the paperless part online."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the bill is high. Last month the toilet was running all the time, constantly. I fixed it already, the flapper thing. So maybe that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would do it. A running toilet can use a lot of water, and sewer is billed off the water used. If the next bill comes down, you'll know it's fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Yes! Go, go, go. Sorry, the game is on. Okay, so, can I pay on a Saturday? Tomorrow? Nobody is open, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall's closed Saturday, but you can pay online any time, day or night. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online, that's the same website for the paperless?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same place, yeah. You'll want your account number off the bill, so keep one handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the old paper one here. Fine. It's just a hassle, you know? Tutto questo per una bolletta. Sorry. All this for one bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The address is changed now, so the next one goes to Bacheller Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, Tony. I go back to my game."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Enjoy it. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
